  },
  "notes": [
    "The analog behavioral module is retained for simulation and downstream handoff even though it is also used as the abstract physical placeholder.",
    "The top-level port set is limited to the required digital register interface plus simulation-visible analog hooks and observability outputs.",
    "No protocol beyond generic register-style control is assumed."
  ],
